# Repo-wide ignore for Docker build context.
# Build context = repo root, so we exclude everything that doesn't need to ship
# into the image: dependencies (reinstalled inside), build outputs, IDE state, docs.

# ── Node / TypeScript ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.nx
**/.angular
**/.next
**/coverage
**/.eslintcache
**/.tsbuildinfo
**/jest.config.*.snap

# ── .NET ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/bin
**/obj
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/*.userprefs
**/*.nupkg
**/.vs
**/TestResults
**/*.trx

# ── Env / secrets (never bake into image) ────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/appsettings.*.local.json
**/secrets/**
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.pfx

# ── Git ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github

# ── IDE / OS noise ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.history
**/*.swp
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# ── CI / docs / scripts not needed at runtime ────────────────────────────────
.artifacts
docs
db-schema
tests/e2e
tests/load
tests/*-e2e
*.md
!apps/*/README.md
LICENSE
scripts/reset-local.sh

# ── Docker meta ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/Dockerfile*
!Dockerfile
**/docker-compose*.yml
infra/docker/docker-compose*.yml
